er b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>magnus666</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1282889-my-demon-the-fallen-timeline-infographic-of-the-war-in-heaven?p=1282992#post1282992\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Holy shit it's awsome, I'm in awe mate , I just have some questions,<br /> First who are &amp;quot;the one before gods&amp;quot; any inspiration or source materiel or are they simply made up? <br /> What is the machine exactly?<br /> and you should be more specific with the &amp;quot;blight&amp;quot; ( it's wod afterall, the word blight is a bit abstract) but since you mentioned the underworld , do you refer to oblivion?<br /> It's a great chronicle overall but my only problem with it is &amp;quot;god is wounded&amp;quot; thingy,<br /> because during the fall he attacked the rebel host by merely touching the world so it kinda contradicts itself.</div> </div> </div> </div>Some of the Fluff included a co versatile Lucifer had with a Monk and the Monk pointing out Maybe God sacrifices himself by touching the world. This naturally surprised and Angered Lucy.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-27T16:50:24-08:00","id":1283142,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>magnus666</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1282889-my-demon-the-fallen-timeline-infographic-of-the-war-in-heaven?p=1282992#post1282992\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Holy shit it's awsome, I'm in awe mate , I just have some questions,<br /> First who are &quot;the one before gods&quot; any inspiration or source materiel or are they simply made up?<br /> What is the machine exactly?<br /> and you should be more specific with the &quot;blight&quot; ( it's wod afterall, the word blight is a bit abstract) but since you mentioned the underworld , do you refer to oblivion?<br /> It's a great chronicle overall but my only problem with it is &quot;god is wounded&quot; thingy,<br /> because during the fall he attacked the rebel host by merely touching the world so it kinda contradicts itself.</div> </div> </div> </div>So there's a lot of context to this that is explained in the actual Chronicle, but basically I created it from scratch with inspiration/integration from the other game lines.<br /> <br /> The Blight is slowly accelerating deterioration of the Universe in the absence of God. It is represented by Oblivion in the Underworld and the discord within the Triat of Werewolf/Mage.<br /> <br /> The Machine was created by Lucifer after the Elohim pressured Michael to allow him back on the Divine Council to help combat the Blight (more on that later). One of the player characters in my chronicle from the beginning decided he was going to try and summon Lucifer in order to control him as a pawn to influence the other demons. He did some awesome stuff in game for about 1 1/2-2 years, culminating in him summoning Lucifer...or so he thought. The other players were horrified when they learned this, but instead he summoned the Machine. Lucifer and another angel built the Machine as a way of trying to stop or slow-down the Blight, and then Lucifer sacrificed himself in a powerful ritual around 30 C.E. in order to fuel the Machine with the faith of the masses. The Machine was summoned by my player's character because the Machine now carriers Lucifer's True Name.<br /> <br /> As for your final comment about God being wounded, I've really embraced the nature of the Fallen's memory issues, which are obscured by the trauma of the Abyss and the confines of the mortal minds they possess. One of the things that the player characters learned over the course of the Chronicle is that they have no specific memories of interacting with God...rather, they have just always know that she existed. Only the Divine Council and Lucifer knew of her death, and they kept this from the other Elohim. In my Chronicle God really was distant from any of the action, with the Elohim supposedly acting on her behalf, typically via Michael's orders.<br /> <br /> One of the enemy Sebettu to the court, during a flashback during the War, asked the other players, &quot;Think about it: if we were dealing with an all powerful God, don't you think the War would have ended long ago?&quot;<br /> <br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13564-trategos_sol","name":"Trategos_Sol","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13564_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"89"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-28T07:46:41-08:00","id":1283259,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Trategos_Sol</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1282889-my-demon-the-fallen-timeline-infographic-of-the-war-in-heaven?p=1283142#post1283142\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> So there's a lot of context to this that is explained in the actual Chronicle, but basically I created it from scratch with inspiration/integration from the other game lines.<br /> <br /> The Blight is slowly accelerating deterioration of the Universe in the absence of God. It is represented by Oblivion in the Underworld and the discord within the Triat of Werewolf/Mage.<br /> <br /> The Machine was created by Lucifer after the Elohim pressured Michael to allow him back on the Divine Council to help combat the Blight (more on that later). One of the player characters in my chronicle from the beginning decided he was going to try and summon Lucifer in order to control him as a pawn to influence the other demons. He did some awesome stuff in game for about 1 1/2-2 years, culminating in him summoning Lucifer...or so he thought. The other players were horrified when they learned this, but instead he summoned the Machine. Lucifer and another angel built the Machine as a way of trying to stop or slow-down the Blight, and then Lucifer sacrificed himself in a powerful ritual around 30 C.E. in order to fuel the Machine with the faith of the masses. The Machine was summoned by my player's character because the Machine now carriers Lucifer's True Name.<br /> <br /> As for your final comment about God being wounded, I've really embraced the nature of the Fallen's memory issues, which are obscured by the trauma of the Abyss and the confines of the mortal minds they possess. One of the things that the player characters learned over the course of the Chronicle is that they have no specific memories of interacting with God...rather, they have just always know that she existed. Only the Divine Council and Lucifer knew of her death, and they kept this from the other Elohim. In my Chronicle God really was distant from any of the action, with the Elohim supposedly acting on her behalf, typically via Michael's orders.<br /> <br /> One of the enemy Sebettu to the court, during a flashback during the War, asked the other players, &quot;Think about it: if we were dealing with an all powerful God, don't you think the War would have ended long ago?&quot;<br /> <br /> <br /></div> </div> </div> </div>I feel like I'm playing god's lawyer now.<br /> Well the deterioration is fairly a good point, even some theorize that the abyss itself is used like some sort of fucked up chemotherapy to hold the oblivion at bay.<br /> and lucifer sacrifice...interesting so you voided his infliuence in LA and dtf novels...bold and I like it.<br /> good luck mate, and look out for those pesky earthbounds.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img31/2512/25ew.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.com/v2/137x125q90/661/nSdTJk.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8612-magnus666","name":"magnus666","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8612_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"26"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-29T19:26:14-08:00","id":1283625,"title":"","content":"Fantastic! You clearly put a lot of time and work into this! Thank you, friend!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Sig","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2319-captotter","name":"CaptOtter","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2319_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"405"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-30T19:28:48-08:00","id":1283834,"title":"","content":"Very cool! Thanks for this!<br /> <br /> What is the purpose or function of the Machine in your Chronicle? A replacement for God? How exactly?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/412-valismedsen","name":"valismedsen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar412_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"391"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-02T18:34:10-08:00","id":1284430,"title":"","content":"Yer bloody awesome.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Forum's Official's Joker and Trickster. Pardon my bad english, aint my first language (I Speak Spanish).<br /> ST: DtF, HtR, WtO, MtA<br /> Signature Chars: Crowley (hakalu), Joe The Nuwisha (WtA)<br /> Changelings: be afraid of the Technocracian High Five of Doom","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1754-crowley","name":"Crowley","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1754_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1639"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-03T08:20:22-08:00","id":1284501,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>valismedsen</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1282889-my-demon-the-fallen-timeline-infographic-of-the-war-in-heaven?p=1283834#post1283834\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Very cool! Thanks for this!<br /> <br /> What is the purpose or function of the Machine in your Chronicle? A replacement for God? How exactly?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Basically, after God died in the War, the universe started to fall apart. Lucifer was basically on parole because so many angels were upset about how much death happened and generally dissatisfied with Michael that they just wanted some normalcy back. Also, the Divine Council (knowing that God was dead, unlike the rest of the Host who were kept in the dark about that), knew that Lucifer might have some knowledge in how to help save the universe. <br /> <br /> So Lucifer and another angel (Risnuch) created the Machine as a kind of Life Support system for the universe. However, it would need a lot of humanity's Faith in order to generate the massive energy required to slow the progression of the Blight (the deterioration of the universe). So Lucifer sacrificed himself in a ritual to inspire Humanity to direct their Faith to the Machine. Lucifer tied his True Name to the Machine so that the belief in him would be collected within the Machine's massive Faith resevoirs.<br /> <br /> That's why humans believe in Jesus and why the Fallen, upon escaping, have no idea where this idea comes from.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13564-trategos_sol","name":"Trategos_Sol","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13564_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"89"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}